# Security policy

## Supported versions

Only the latest release gets security fixes. Update to the newest version from the [Releases page](https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ name }}/releases).

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please don't open a public issue for a security problem. Report it privately through GitHub instead:

1. Go to the repository's [Security tab](https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ name }}/security).
2. Click **Report a vulnerability**.
3. Describe the problem, the {{ display_name }} version and OS, and how to reproduce it.

You should hear back within a week. {{ display_name }} is maintained by one person in their spare time, so a fix can take longer. You'll be credited in the advisory unless you'd rather not be.
